<h1 data-i18n="privacy.title">Privacy Policy</h1>

<p data-i18n="privacy.intro">
  This is a static website. We do not offer user accounts and we do not ask you to submit personal
  information to use the site.
</p>

<h2 data-i18n="privacy.collect.title">Information we collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong data-i18n="privacy.collect.tech.label">Basic technical data:</strong>
    <span data-i18n="privacy.collect.tech.desc">
      like most websites, our hosting provider may log standard request data (e.g. IP address, user agent,
      referrer, timestamps) for security and performance.
    </span>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong data-i18n="privacy.collect.analytics.label">Optional analytics:</strong>
    <span data-i18n="privacy.collect.analytics.desc">
      if enabled, a third-party analytics provider may collect usage data to help us understand site traffic.
    </span>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong data-i18n="privacy.collect.local.label">Local preferences and lists:</strong>
    <span data-i18n="privacy.collect.local.desc">
      we may store small preferences (e.g. language and theme) and optional local lists (e.g. saved items,
      recently viewed, and read markers) in your browser using localStorage.
    </span>
  </li>
</ul>

<h2 data-i18n="privacy.notCollect.title">What we do not collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li data-i18n="privacy.notCollect.accounts">We do not collect passwords or create accounts.</li>
  <li data-i18n="privacy.notCollect.sensitive">We do not intentionally collect sensitive personal data.</li>
  <li data-i18n="privacy.notCollect.sell">We do not sell personal information.</li>
  <li data-i18n="privacy.notCollect.search">
    Site search runs locally in your browser; we do not receive your search queries.
  </li>
</ul>

<h2 data-i18n="privacy.external.title">External links</h2>
<p data-i18n="privacy.external.note">
  This site links to third-party websites. Their privacy practices are governed by their own
  policies.
</p>

<h2 data-i18n="privacy.affiliate.title">Affiliate links</h2>
<p data-i18n="privacy.affiliate.note">
  Some links may be affiliate links. If you buy through those links, we may earn a commission at no
  additional cost to you.
</p>

<h2 data-i18n="privacy.changes.title">Changes</h2>
<p data-i18n="privacy.changes.note">
  We may update this policy from time to time by publishing a new version on this page.
</p>
